meta {
  name: Providers - Pause
  type: http
  seq: 29
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/super-admin/v1/models/providers/:provider/pause
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{superAdminToken}}
}

params:path {
  provider: openai
}

body:json {
  {
    "reason": "Our OpenAI key leaked on GitHub",
    "totp_code": "123456"
  }
}

docs {
  The kill switch. Stops the platform using the provider on every route, at once: for a leaked key, an outage or a cost runaway. A workspace's own key for the same provider keeps working. Needs a reason and a fresh code, and raises an alert.
}
